  "text": "I did a 600km four day bike ride across Kuyushu Japan last week. \n\nFor this I made myself and all other 200+ riders with me a a companion app. \n\nIt shows a live rain radar along the actual gpx route, the toughest climbs of the day and the konbinis in between. \n\nBig fan. More soon https://t.co/ZzwJKzvCOU",
